{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00909","headline":"鼓吹曲辞 鼓吹铙歌 铁山碎 · 柳宗元","name":"鼓吹曲辞 鼓吹铙歌 铁山碎","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"铁山碎，大漠舒。\n二虏劲，连穹庐。\n背北海，专坤隅。\n岁来侵边，或傅于都。\n天子命元帅，奋其雄图。\n破定襄，降魁渠。\n穷竟窟宅，斥余吾。\n百蛮破胆，边氓苏。\n威武辉耀，明鬼区。\n利泽弥万祀，功不可踰。\n官臣拜手，惟帝之谟。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"柳宗元","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_00909.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00909","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}